      "containerId": "node-J",
      "originalText": "Every marker is represented\nno Parent-boundary spill\nnested item requires parent_item_key\ntop-level item may have parent_item_key=None\npage marker/comment absent\ntable/code atomic\nbullet group has logical_item_keys\nsplit metadata consistent\nParent has Child or context_only_reason",
